OL,3,GNEWSASecond arrest after man stabbed in
OL,4,Ashop
OL,5,
OL,6,FA second person has been arrested after
OL,7,Fa man was seriously injured in a
OL,8,Fstabbing inside a convenience store in
OL,9,FSutton-in-Ashfield.
OL,11,FNottinghamshire Police was called to
OL,12,FOutram Street shortly after 18:00 BST
OL,13,Fon 4 August following the attack.
OL,15,FAn 18-year-old man was chased into the
OL,16,Fshop and attacked, the force added. He
OL,17,Fwas taken to hospital, after he was
OL,18,Ffound in the street with serious stab
OL,19,Finjuries but has since been discharged.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
