OL,3,GNEWSASecond arrest after man stabbed in
OL,4,Ashop
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 16-year-old boy was arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of committing grievous bodily
OL,8,Fharm with intent shortly after, and has
OL,9,Fbeen released on police bail. A
OL,10,F20-year-old man was detained on
OL,11,Fsuspicion of wounding with intent after
OL,12,Fhanding himself in on Wednesday, police
OL,13,Fadded.
